---
// The site has one look, the dark arcade one, so this stands in for
// Starlight's theme provider: it always sets the dark theme, whatever a
// reader's system prefers or an earlier visit stored. ThemeSelect.astro draws
// no picker.
---

{/* Inlined so the theme is set before the page is drawn. */}
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
